    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "You know, I've just told them to look, you need to enjoy every minute of it, that those four years passed very quickly. You know, we think you look at, you know, four years, 48 months and you think, man, that's a lifetime, but in actuality, I think we all look back and we see how quickly that time passed. And also look to experience everything that you can. There are some great opportunities there and you won't go until you try it, you know, whether there's going to be things that you'll enjoy or not. So experience those opportunities that Mississippi State has to offer. and make sure that, you know, you're making those friendships because the friendships that you make in college will last a lifetime.",
