    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96041.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 34,
    "turn_text": "Well, we've really been able to utilize our interns well and you're right. I think when they come out, they have a greater appreciation and greater understanding of how the federal government works, the impact that it has on everyone's life on a daily basis. And I think they have a really a new appreciation just of the political world in general. So it's been very good and we want to continue to utilize that every way that we can.",
